WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:19.182
"I can't go back to Magica!" Zann blurted out. "Not without finding my parents."

2
00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:22.560
"Don't be a fool, boy," Wyssa snapped.

3
00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:28.986
"I know I can find them," Zann retorted. "I even have a clue—World X.

4
00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.645
I know my parents wanted to find it.

5
00:00:31.646 --> 00:00:35.446
Maybe that's where they are—they could be trapped there!"

6
00:00:35.447 --> 00:00:43.231
Wyssa looked startled. "How do you know about—never mind," she said, interrupting herself.

7
00:00:43.232 --> 00:00:46.345
"Yes, it's true they wanted to find World X.

8
00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.957
But I have no idea where it is.

9
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:55.317
I promise I'll try to find out—after you and your friends are safely back in Magica."

10
00:00:55.318 --> 00:00:58.886
"That sounds like a good offer, Zann," Gliss said.

11
00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:04.576
Ignoring her, Zann glared at Wyssa. "They're my parents," he said.

12
00:01:04.577 --> 00:01:08.549
"Nobody cares about finding them as much as I do!"

13
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.876
"I'm not so sure about that, boy," Wyssa muttered.

14
00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:17.343
"Morb is—" Once again she stopped herself.

15
00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:21.949
"Morb?" Perda spoke up. "What does he have to do with this?"

16
00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.724
"Forget it. I shouldn't have said anything."

17
00:01:24.725 --> 00:01:28.504
Wyssa stalked off toward the wormhole. "Let's go."

18
00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:32.283
"Not until you tell me what's going on," Zann said.

19
00:01:32.284 --> 00:01:37.247
"Why did you mention Morb? Is he looking for my parents too?"

20
00:01:37.248 --> 00:01:42.478
Wyssa scowled and then sighed. "I suppose you deserve to know.

21
00:01:42.479 --> 00:01:46.696
Maybe it will convince you not to rush off by yourself.

22
00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:52.525
Yes, I've heard rumors that Morb is looking for your parents. Nobody knows why."

23
00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:57.643
Zann froze. What could Morb possibly want with Zann's parents?

24
00:01:57.644 --> 00:02:02.158
"Hold on," Perda said. "How can Morb be searching for anyone?

25
00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:06.756
I thought he went back to being a Void when Zann defeated him."

26
00:02:06.757 --> 00:02:11.121
"I don't know how he's able to use the wormholes," Wyssa said.

27
00:02:11.122 --> 00:02:15.666
"But he's not keeping his search a secret." She grimaced.

28
00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:19.526
"He's left a trail of terrified worlds behind him."

29
00:02:19.527 --> 00:02:26.595
Perda's eyes widened. "That must be why the Skellians freaked out when we mentioned Morb's name!"

30
00:02:26.596 --> 00:02:33.685
"Whatever," Zann said to Wyssa. "I'm still not going back to Magica."

31
00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:37.816
He rubbed both hands on his legs, hoping this spell would work.

32
00:02:37.817 --> 00:02:42.169
Touching the trunk of a sturdy tree, he cried, "Shackle!"

33
00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:46.662
It worked! Magical shackles appeared, binding Zann to the tree.

34
00:02:46.663 --> 00:02:51.060
Wyssa gnashed her teeth. "Stop this foolishness!

35
00:02:51.061 --> 00:02:55.138
Remove those shackles at once, or I'll do it for you."

36
00:02:55.139 --> 00:03:00.731
"You can't," Perda said. "Nobody can remove another person's Shackle spell."

37
00:03:00.732 --> 00:03:05.022
"She's right. And you won't change my mind," Zann said.

38
00:03:05.023 --> 00:03:11.488
"Take my friends home, and then we can search together. Otherwise I'll search on my own."

39
00:03:11.489 --> 00:03:17.030
"You don't know what you're doing, boy." Wyssa narrowed her eyes at Zann.

40
00:03:17.031 --> 00:03:24.389
"If even half the rumors about Morb's new powers are true, you won't have a chance against him."

41
00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:30.608
Zann stared at her. "You can't make me do anything," he said defiantly.

42
00:03:30.609 --> 00:03:33.920
"You didn't even know when Morb was tricking you!"

43
00:03:33.921 --> 00:03:36.788
"What are you talking about?" Wyssa demanded.

44
00:03:36.789 --> 00:03:43.643
"When you sent my parents off course with that scatter beast, it wasn't an accident," said Zann.

45
00:03:43.644 --> 00:03:48.607
"It was part of Morb's plan. He told me so himself."

46
00:03:48.608 --> 00:03:55.118
Wyssa's eyes went wide. "What?" Her yell echoed through the quiet forest.

47
00:03:55.119 --> 00:04:01.560
She leaped forward and touched Zann's forehead. "Truth!" she intoned.

48
00:04:01.561 --> 00:04:06.682
"Ow!" Zann yelped as he felt a sizzling sensation in his head.

49
00:04:06.683 --> 00:04:12.482
A second later Wyssa backed away, her eyes burning with rage.

50
00:04:12.483 --> 00:04:17.287
"So it is true," she said through gritted teeth.

51
00:04:17.288 --> 00:04:27.746
"I've been torturing myself all these years, thinking I was to blame for your parents' disappearance. Morb will pay for this!"

52
00:04:27.747 --> 00:04:36.208
Alarmed, Zann glanced at his friends. They were all staring at Wyssa in silence. Zing cowered behind Darb.

53
00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:40.308
Wyssa swept toward Zann again. "Release!" she said.

54
00:04:40.309 --> 00:04:45.457
The shackles exploded. Zann gasped. "How did you—"

55
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:48.785
Before he could finish, Wyssa grabbed Gliss.

56
00:04:48.786 --> 00:04:52.204
"You're in charge now, Red," Wyssa said.

57
00:04:52.205 --> 00:04:56.199
"Take Zann and these others straight back to Magica."

58
00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:01.993
"I . . . I . . . ," Gliss stammered. She seemed too scared to speak.

59
00:05:01.994 --> 00:05:06.232
"This will ensure that you follow my orders, girl."

60
00:05:06.233 --> 00:05:09.043
Wyssa put her hands over Gliss' face.

61
00:05:09.044 --> 00:05:14.978
When the old woman pulled them away, glowing purple goggles covered Gliss' eyes.

62
00:05:14.979 --> 00:05:18.907
"Those goggles will show you the way," Wyssa said.

63
00:05:18.908 --> 00:05:23.143
"They'll also provide extra magic for navigating the vortex.

64
00:05:23.144 --> 00:05:32.208
But don't try to remove them until all of you are safely back in Magica, or you'll suffer intense pain."

65
00:05:32.209 --> 00:05:35.991
"I . . . I understand," Gliss said.

66
00:05:35.992 --> 00:05:45.732
"Good." Wyssa leaped for the wormhole. "Revenge will be mine!" she cried as she disappeared.

67
00:05:45.733 --> 00:05:51.327
"Wow," Perda said, her voice shaking. "That was scary!"

68
00:05:51.328 --> 00:05:55.062
Zann nodded, no longer doubting Wyssa's power.

69
00:05:55.063 --> 00:06:01.181
For a moment they all stayed quiet. "Maybe Wyssa is right," Zann thought.

70
00:06:01.182 --> 00:06:04.543
Maybe it was better to let her handle the search . . .

71
00:06:04.544 --> 00:06:09.602
Finally Gliss spoke up. "Zann, what do you want me to do?"

72
00:06:09.603 --> 00:06:15.231
Zann turned to her and sighed. "It's not like we have much choice."

73
00:06:15.232 --> 00:06:21.050
"There's always a choice." Gliss took a deep breath and reached for the goggles.

74
00:06:21.051 --> 00:06:23.318
"No!" Darb cried.

75
00:06:23.319 --> 00:06:26.451
"Gliss!" said Zann. "You don't have to—"

76
00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:30.680
"Aah!" cried Gliss, ripping the goggles from her face.

77
00:06:30.681 --> 00:06:35.405
She collapsed on the ground, writhing and crying out in pain.

78
00:06:35.406 --> 00:06:41.556
Darb rushed over to her. A minute later she was able to climb back to her feet.

79
00:06:41.557 --> 00:06:51.882
"Th—there," Gliss said. "If you want to continue your search, I won't stop you. In fact I'll come along."

80
00:06:51.883 --> 00:06:55.082
Perda looked at Zann. "We all will."

81
00:06:55.083 --> 00:06:58.806
Zann gulped. Putting himself in danger was one thing.

82
00:06:58.807 --> 00:07:02.429
But could he also risk his friends' lives again?

83
00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.891
"Are you sure?" he asked.

84
00:07:04.892 --> 00:07:09.947
Gliss, Perda, and Darb nodded. Zing let out an excited whistle.

85
00:07:09.948 --> 00:07:15.237
Zann suddenly felt braver. He and his friends had defeated Morb once before.

86
00:07:15.238 --> 00:07:19.537
They made a powerful team, the kind of team that could do anything.

87
00:07:19.538 --> 00:07:25.593
"Okay," he told them. "Let's go!"
